{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience trucking on a new level: by <strong>driving</strong> and <strong>interacting with the world around you</strong>. Make your truck unique by <strong>customizing it mechanically and visuall</strong>y, inside and outside. Meet people and decide how to approach them. Enjoy the beautiful scenery in different weather conditions. But most of all, <strong>see the change</strong> you\u2019re making by supporting the economy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy our dream trucking game that combines a classic truck simulator with RPG in an approachable, pleasant way.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your own truck by customizing its interior and exterior.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the engine, brakes, suspension, and other parts that affect <strong>driving simulation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate using GPS or look for <strong>uncharted</strong> roads and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>challenges</strong> that bring extra rewards but come with extra risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the engine brake, cruise control, and lean out of the window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the results of your jobs - places built or restored with the goods you delivered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE A BUSINESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over an old, unused airstrip and turn it into your <strong>base</strong> of trucking operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and <strong>upgrade</strong> workstations to unlock repair and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate and <strong>repair</strong> components, and keep your truck clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up vitality, charm, and other stats that change up the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get passive income from the businesses and people you support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVE A TRUCKER'S LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>beautiful</strong> open world with a day-night cycle and dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, sleep, and treat injuries and conditions that affect your <strong>abilities</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit walk-in stores, garages, offices, and other <strong>interactive</strong> locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests for your fellow townsfolk and friends made along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed atmosphere of life on the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* * *</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vale Rico \u2013 a small yet geographically varied country in South America. Your town is old and neglected, but you can make a difference. Bring back its former glory the only way you know: from behind your truck\u2019s wheel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to start your business, become an inspiration to others, and reinvigorate the economy! Finished with the main story? Good, it was just the beginning - continue and immerse yourself in the open-ended trucking RPG gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333190?t=1757489994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/022f27d1e8ef999f06aa4a49728abd4b43920085/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757489994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/b9c7cbaa9960de116366d308db8cec95556ad3bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757489994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/b9c7cbaa9960de116366d308db8cec95556ad3bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757489994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience trucking on a new level: by <strong>driving</strong> and <strong>interacting with the world around you</strong>. Make your truck unique by <strong>customizing it mechanically and visuall</strong>y, inside and outside. Meet people and decide how to approach them. Enjoy the beautiful scenery in different weather conditions. But most of all, <strong>see the change</strong> you\u2019re making by supporting the economy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy our dream trucking game that combines a classic truck simulator with RPG in an approachable, pleasant way.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/98cb6d7f35d92dc3837165148b26defd.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your own truck by customizing its interior and exterior.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the engine, brakes, suspension, and other parts that affect <strong>driving simulation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate using GPS or look for <strong>uncharted</strong> roads and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>challenges</strong> that bring extra rewards but come with extra risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the engine brake, cruise control, and lean out of the window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the results of your jobs - places built or restored with the goods you delivered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE A BUSINESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/79d659ec117a1871e03c456e7f081c6d.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over an old, unused airstrip and turn it into your <strong>base</strong> of trucking operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and <strong>upgrade</strong> workstations to unlock repair and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate and <strong>repair</strong> components, and keep your truck clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up vitality, charm, and other stats that change up the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get passive income from the businesses and people you support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVE A TRUCKER'S LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.poster.avif?t=1757489994\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.webm?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/60a5f49a71c3f44fabeaad272a0b8ea3.mp4?t=1757489994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>beautiful</strong> open world with a day-night cycle and dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, sleep, and treat injuries and conditions that affect your <strong>abilities</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit walk-in stores, garages, offices, and other <strong>interactive</strong> locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests for your fellow townsfolk and friends made along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed atmosphere of life on the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* * *</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vale Rico \u2013 a small yet geographically varied country in South America. Your town is old and neglected, but you can make a difference. Bring back its former glory the only way you know: from behind your truck\u2019s wheel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to start your business, become an inspiration to others, and reinvigorate the economy! Finished with the main story? Good, it was just the beginning - continue and immerse yourself in the open-ended trucking RPG gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Road Studio S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/3cab1057c3d1aad5cc94cabdd6aa8e3221c60ec2/header.jpg?t=1757489994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188453,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188453/movie480.mp4?t=1756128596","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188453/movie_max.mp4?t=1756128596"},"name":"Customization Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188453/6e020da3be706b3fd0968449fe17d8f5ef082596/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756128596","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188453/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756128596","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188453/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756128596"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257172833,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172833/movie480.mp4?t=1753276489","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172833/movie_max.mp4?t=1753276489"},"name":"Gameplay Reveal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172833/68a336af7d210a0031e4427a49cc65fbc73a22f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753276489","we